@startuml
!include ../includes/attestify-theme.puml
!include ../includes/sequence-conventions.puml
title Staged Verification Lifecycle
actor User
participant "nape start" as Start
participant "Current run" as Run
participant "nape evidence" as Evidence
participant "nape verify" as Verify
User -> Start: Procedure source + subject + metadata
Start -> Run: atomically select new collecting run
loop one file at a time
  User -> Evidence: Action selector + source file
  Evidence -> Run: stable read and atomic association
end
User -> Verify: no arguments
Verify -> Run: freeze complete inputs
Verify -> Run: atomically commit completed output
@enduml
